props.description:
Number of equal columns (`3`), or a full `grid-template-columns` value
(`"2fr 1fr"`). Pass a per-breakpoint object to change it responsively;
mobile-first, a missing breakpoint inherits the smaller one.

components.description:
An inline message about the state of the page or a form. `neutral` is the default; `error` and
`warning` are announced immediately, the rest politely. Put optional actions in `children`;
for short-lived feedback use `useToast` instead.

examples:
"use client";
import NextLink from "next/link";
<LinkProvider component={NextLink}>{children}</LinkProvider>
